WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.768 --> 00:00:22.964
"Your hair is too long," Mom said to the boys.

2
00:00:22.965 --> 00:00:27.761
"But I can't take you for a haircut today."

3
00:00:27.762 --> 00:00:31.533
"No problem," Aunt Judy said.

4
00:00:31.534 --> 00:00:36.079
"I'll take them to the hair salon."

5
00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:40.387
"I want a buzz cut!" Harry said.

6
00:00:40.388 --> 00:00:45.801
"Me too," Oliver said.

7
00:00:45.802 --> 00:00:50.267
At the salon Oliver sat in a big chair.

8
00:00:50.268 --> 00:00:55.551
The stylist made it go up and up.

9
00:00:55.552 --> 00:00:59.304
"Now I can reach you," she said.

10
00:00:59.305 --> 00:01:02.976
The stylist turned on her hair clipper.

11
00:01:02.977 --> 00:01:05.736
Buzz. Buzz.

12
00:01:05.737 --> 00:01:08.211
Oliver frowned.

13
00:01:08.212 --> 00:01:12.738
"What if I don't like my haircut?"

14
00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:18.066
"Don't worry. It'll grow back," Aunt Judy said.

15
00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:22.142
The stylist finished Oliver's haircut.

16
00:01:22.143 --> 00:01:25.524
Then she started cutting Harry's hair.

17
00:01:25.525 --> 00:01:30.095
Buzz. Buzz.

18
00:01:30.096 --> 00:01:34.345
"What if I look weird with a buzz cut?" he asked.

19
00:01:34.346 --> 00:01:39.195
"Don't worry. It'll grow out," Aunt Judy said.

20
00:01:39.196 --> 00:01:43.547
"Hmm. I think I'll get a haircut too."

21
00:01:43.548 --> 00:01:47.737
Another stylist washed Aunt Judy's hair.

22
00:01:47.738 --> 00:01:52.324
Then Aunt Judy sat in a chair next to Harry.

23
00:01:52.325 --> 00:01:56.425
The stylist picked up his scissors and comb.

24
00:01:56.426 --> 00:02:01.772
"I just want a trim," Aunt Judy said.

25
00:02:01.773 --> 00:02:05.573
After their haircuts the boys were happy.

26
00:02:05.574 --> 00:02:09.452
"I like my buzz cut!" Harry said.

27
00:02:09.453 --> 00:02:13.960
"Me too!" Oliver said.

28
00:02:13.961 --> 00:02:16.776
Aunt Judy made a face.

29
00:02:16.777 --> 00:02:22.228
"My hair is too short," she said.

30
00:02:22.229 --> 00:02:26.494
"Don't worry," the boys said together.

31
00:02:26.495 --> 00:02:34.523
"It'll grow back!"
